{"id":"rec2073587751","recordType":"940","template":"","html":"<div id=\"rec2073587751\" class=\"r t-rec t-rec_pt_0 t-rec_pt-res-480_15 t-rec_pb_15 t-rec_pb-res-480_15\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:15px;background-color:#020202; \" data-animationappear=\"off\" data-record-type=\"940\" data-bg-color=\"#020202\"> <!-- t940 --> <div class=\"t940\"> <div class=\"t-section__container t-container t-container_flex js-block-header\"> <div class=\"t-col t-col_10 t-prefix_1\"> <div\nclass=\"js-block-header-title t-section__title t-title t-title_xs t-align_left t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-group=\"yes\" data-editable=\"true\"\nfield=\"btitle\"> <span style=\"color: inherit; background-image: linear-gradient(0turn, rgb(124, 124, 124) 0%, rgb(175, 175, 175) 100%); background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; caret-color: rgb(124, 124, 124);\">что входит в модуль?</span> </div> <div\nclass=\"js-block-header-descr t-section__descr t-descr t-descr_xl t-align_left t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-group=\"yes\" data-editable=\"true\"\nfield=\"bdescr\"> <div style=\"font-size: 24px;\" data-customstyle=\"yes\"><span style=\"font-family: InterTight; font-weight: 600;\">За 5 модулей и 65 уроков</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: InterTight; font-weight: 600;\">теории и практики,вы:</span></div> </div> </div> </div> <style>.t-section__title,.t-section__descr {overflow-wrap:break-word;}.t-section__descr {max-width:560px;}#rec2073587751 .t-section__title {margin-bottom:40px;}#rec2073587751 .t-section__descr {margin-bottom:90px;}#rec2073587751 .t-section__container:not(:has(.t-section__descr)) .t-section__title {margin-bottom:90px;}@media screen and (max-width:960px) {#rec2073587751 .t-section__title {margin-bottom:20px;}#rec2073587751 .t-section__descr {margin-bottom:45px;}#rec2073587751 .t-section__container:not(:has(.t-section__descr)) .t-section__title {margin-bottom:45px;}}</style> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-section__title{line-height:1.05;color:#ffffff;padding-top:0px;}#rec2073587751 .t-section__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__container t940__container t-container \"> <div class=\"t940__row t940__row_indent-10px t-row\"> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_boxed t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-card__title{font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;}#rec2073587751 .t-card__descr{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'InterTight';font-weight:400;opacity:0.8;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__2234858972420\">\n1.Соберёте тело в систему\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__2234858972420\">\nНе “вылечите спину” — а получите целостный подход к телу, в котором всё работает слаженно\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.50), rgba(0,0,0,0.60));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3061-3936-4638-b932-326639383630/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__2234858972420\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3061-3936-4638-b932-326639383630/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png'); background-color: #fffdfd;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3061-3936-4638-b932-326639383630/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-card__title{font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;}#rec2073587751 .t-card__descr{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'InterTight';font-weight:400;opacity:0.8;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__2244858972421\">\n2.Восстановите правильное дыхание\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__2244858972421\">\nЧерез него — наладится нервная система, улучшится осанка, нормализуется работа корпуса\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.50), rgba(0,0,0,0.60));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3465-6361-4539-b565-623730666332/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__2244858972421\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3465-6361-4539-b565-623730666332/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png'); background-color: #fffdfd;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3465-6361-4539-b565-623730666332/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-card__title{font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;}#rec2073587751 .t-card__descr{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'InterTight';font-weight:400;opacity:0.8;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__2244858972422\">\n3.Выстроите осанку и верх тела\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__2244858972422\">\nУйдёт сутулость, зажатость трапеций, напряжение в шее и между лопатками\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.50), rgba(0,0,0,0.60));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild6662-6235-4666-a563-393032333336/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__2244858972422\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild6662-6235-4666-a563-393032333336/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png'); background-color: #fffdfd;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild6662-6235-4666-a563-393032333336/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_boxed t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-card__title{font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;}#rec2073587751 .t-card__descr{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'InterTight';font-weight:400;opacity:0.8;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__1775977322969\">\n4.Нормализуете работу <br />таза и поясницы\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__1775977322969\">\nЭто центральный узел тела, через который уходит большинство проблем с низом спины\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.50), rgba(0,0,0,0.60));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild6537-3636-4261-b234-613961326131/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__1775977322969\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild6537-3636-4261-b234-613961326131/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png'); background-color: #fffdfd;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild6537-3636-4261-b234-613961326131/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-card__title{font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;}#rec2073587751 .t-card__descr{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'InterTight';font-weight:400;opacity:0.8;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__1590744686568\">\n5.Получите устойчивую опору через стопы и колени\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__1590744686568\">\nПравильная нижняя цепь — это база для движения, ходьбы, тренировок\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.50), rgba(0,0,0,0.60));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild6363-6462-4939-a330-343038636131/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__1590744686568\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild6363-6462-4939-a330-343038636131/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png'); background-color: #fffdfd;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild6363-6462-4939-a330-343038636131/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__row t940__row_indent-10px t-row\"> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_indent-10px t-item t-animate\" data-animate-style=\"zoomin\" data-animate-chain=\"yes\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_half t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__content_middle t940__animation_fast \"> <style> #rec2073587751 .t-card__title{font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;}#rec2073587751 .t-card__descr{font-size:15px;color:#ffffff;font-family:'InterTight';font-weight:400;opacity:0.8;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__1776531146133\">\n6.Соберёте всё в реальное движение\n</div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__1776531146133\">\nНовая походка, новые двигательные привычки, новое качество жизни\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_fast\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.50), rgba(0,0,0,0.60));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_fast\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3638-6635-4235-b564-633630383731/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__1776531146133\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3638-6635-4235-b564-633630383731/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png'); background-color: #fffdfd;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3638-6635-4235-b564-633630383731/ChatGPT_Image_18__20.png\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  <style> #rec2073587751 .t940__card{border-radius:5px;}</style> </div>"}